BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.5 Tm 16 TL /F5 11.5 Tf .14902 .215686 .184314 rg (Roe) Tj /F4 11.5 Tf ( recognized constitutional protection for the decision to terminate a pregnancy and established a) Tj T* (framework for balancing that protection against state interests. ) Tj /F5 11.5 Tf (Casey) Tj /F4 11.5 Tf ( retained the central protection for) Tj T* (pre-viability abortion while replacing ) Tj /F5 11.5 Tf (Roe) Tj /F4 11.5 Tf (\222s trimester framework with the undue-burden standard. Under) Tj T* /F5 11.5 Tf (Casey) Tj /F4 11.5 Tf (, a restriction was invalid if its purpose or effect was to place a substantial obstacle in the path of a) Tj T* (person seeking a pre-viability abortion. [2, 3]) Tj T* ET
