BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.5 Tm /F4 11.5 Tf 16 TL (That distinction mattered to the challenge against Mississippi\222s law. Regulation and prohibition were not) Tj T* (interchangeable under the existing framework: a state could regulate abortion within constitutional limits,) Tj T* (but it could not impose a pre-viability ban. The federal district court blocked the fifteen-week law, and the) Tj T* (Fifth Circuit affirmed. Both courts applied the Supreme Court precedents that remained binding at the) Tj T* (time. [1]) Tj T* ET
